{
  "id": "c1-e39-a-matter-of-time",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "A matter of time",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how good are you at managing your time?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you work better under pressure?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what is your attitude to deadlines?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what advice would you give about making the most of your time?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e39-a1",
            "c1-e39-a2",
            "c1-e39-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people using their time. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might have been doing before, and how they might be feeling about their time.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these people do you think is making the best use of their time?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e39-b1",
            "c1-e39-b2",
            "c1-e39-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people dealing with time pressure. Choose two of the pictures and say what is causing the pressure, and what the people could do about it.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you deal with interruptions?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways of using time more effectively, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e39-a-matter-of-time",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How useful might these methods be for someone with a very busy life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e39-a-matter-of-time",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most valuable?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about time management and productivity.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is being busy something that people take too much pride in?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent can technology help us manage our time better?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people are more productive when they work fewer hours?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How should schools help students to manage their time?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is procrastination a sign of laziness or something else?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think it is possible to do several things well at the same time?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e39-a-matter-of-time/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
